<title>UK: C&amp;W to bid for Singapore fixed-line licence.</title>
<headline>C&amp;W to bid for Singapore fixed-line licence.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cable and Wireless Plc, Britain's second biggest telecoms company, said on Tuesday it had linked up with its subsidiary Hong Kong Telecommunications Ltd, The Keppel Group and Singapore Press Holdings Ltd to bid for a fixed-wire licence in Singapore.</p>
</text>
